    <h1>PRD Compass to Secured Zone Integration</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
 <div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-current">IN REVI=
EW</span></p>
    <h1 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-FeaturePositioning"><span>=
Feature Positioning</span></h1>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-FeatureOverview">Feature O=
verview</h2>
    <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol"=
>This feature enables external users to access SecureZone (SZ) applications=
 seamlessly through Compass by combining:</p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"7356682b-fbd3-4386-b216-bb1f80a14bff"><strong>Single Sign-On (SSO)</str=
ong> for authentication and access</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"75e30060-2107-4c45-9322-81a77e788228"><strong>Centralized provisioning<=
/strong> for identity linking (CX ID =E2=86=94 SZ ID) and entitlement manag=
ement</li>
    </ul>
    <p><br>
      Through this capability:</p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"8491c135-1f44-4f48-bed3-578950a7b3c4">Compass becomes the <strong>singl=
e entry point</strong> for all SZ applications for clients&nbsp;</li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"47505322-7c43-4e09-b7f8-3f9eff7dec8b">ID Administrators manage <strong>=
user access centrally via feature packages</strong></li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"a9241b30-581e-49ea-b681-36958920092b">Users authenticate once and acces=
s all entitled SZ apps without additional login prompts</li>
    </ul>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p>
     <style type=3D"text/css">/*<![CDATA[*/
