    <p><br></p>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-ProblemStatement"><span st=
yle=3D"font-size: 20.0px;letter-spacing: -0.008em;">Problem Statement</span=
></h2>
    <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol"=
>Across all four stages, the current model lacks:</p>
    <ul>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"acc31f6e-8944-4f21-849f-67892477485d">A <strong>single identity and acc=
ess control system</strong></li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"4fd6a9b2-cf3d-468a-b9be-ec4560ce6d1a">A <strong>standardized provisioni=
ng and entitlement model</strong></li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"62aefab6-d26b-499a-a327-89ba94f3feca">A <strong>seamless authentication=
 and access experience</strong></li>
     <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uuid=
=3D"0d67ea9a-439a-4710-a4e0-bfab0378741b">A <strong>centralized lifecycle (=
provision =E2=86=92 access =E2=86=92 deprovision)</strong></li>
    </ul>
    <p><br></p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 83.7673%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 12.6219%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 24.5865%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 21.8415%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 19.9784%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 20.9717%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">User Journey</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Access Provisioning (Befor=
e Access)=E2=86=92</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Authentication (Login Expe=
rience) =E2=86=92</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">App Access (Post-Login Exp=
erience) =E2=86=92</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Access Deprovisioning</th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Key Frictions</th>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#fdd0ec confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#fdd0ec">
         <ul title=3D"">
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"f6bb8bb0-d019-47d2-88d2-f1d2ff91c0ad">Identity setup is fragmented =
across systems (CX ID vs SZ ID) with no centralized linking mechanism</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"691d6edc-2154-4f83-9839-188a92881113">Access provisioning is:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Man=
ual</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mul=
ti-step</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Dep=
endent on operations teams</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"f4ebc58b-9482-4857-9f8a-03fa64e185dd">SZ app entitlements are not s=
tandardized or aligned with feature packaging</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"0dca8d95-e67e-4a85-8af8-5a498a37a08b">High risk of:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mis=
sing or incorrect access</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Del=
ayed onboarding</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#fdd0ec confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#fdd0ec">
         <ul title=3D"">
          <li data-uuid=3D"228c8543-91b0-43dd-84ad-176258f07b05">Users must=
 authenticate multiple times across Compass and SZ apps</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"8a96adc4-5951-434e-a2a4-8f103119e425">Authentica=
tion methods are inconsistent and rely on legacy mechanisms</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"0779ce52-2728-43fe-9801-89e6d53ba8d7">Lack of ce=
ntralized identity enforcement (e.g., MFA via enterprise IDP)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3c94e96a-9158-4a5c-86a4-4f9d498457dc">Session be=
havior is inconsistent across applications</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#fdd0ec confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#fdd0ec">
         <ul title=3D"">
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"26714c47-9203-4108-8ead-568ee04766a5">Users access SZ apps via:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Sep=
arate portals</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Dir=
ect URLs</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"3767e138-bc65-42b2-95d1-bf67e305f365">No unified navigation or entr=
y point</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"9d2b5acc-861f-4662-923c-687e58175ebe">Access may fail due to:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mis=
sing entitlements</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Ide=
ntity mismatches</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"cf5355a3-c7bb-487c-8ed0-21829114179e">No consistent handling of acc=
ess errors</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#fdd0ec confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#fdd0ec">
         <ul title=3D"">
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"7c727d69-5f5c-4e84-a3a4-e1530e6135ce">Removal of access is:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Man=
ual and disconnected across systems</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"3fa38689-c52d-4015-827d-cd77ee92bbed">No centralized enforcement wh=
en:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Use=
r is deactivated</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Acc=
ess is removed</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"83e0bbac-1b14-4ae3-a257-c4b4256c3408">Risk of:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Orp=
haned access</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Sec=
urity and compliance exposure</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Results</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Users are not reliably provisioned with =
the correct identity and access upfront.</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1ia=
xwol">Poor login experience, reduced adoption, and increased security risk.=
</p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Users experience friction, confusion, an=
d inconsistent access across applications.</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Access is not reliably revoked, increasi=
ng operational and regulatory risk.</td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Opportunities</th>
        <td class=3D"highlight-#abf5d1 confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#abf5d1">
         <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1ia=
xwol">Enable ID Administrators to:</p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"a8cdbe76-2e19-4995-9ab1-d3d534ed5296">Link <strong>SZ ID to CX ID</=
strong> via Compass user admin tool</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"0de2e04c-e9e2-430f-99ca-6a837ef18e79">Create and manage identity ma=
ppings</li>
         </ul><br>
          Enable provisioning of SZ app access through:=20
         <ul>
