 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h2 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-BenefitsHypothesis">Benefi=
ts Hypothesis</h2>
    <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwol"=
>If SZ access is centralized via Compass (SSO + provisioning), here are the=
 benefits:</p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 56.5626%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 24.2988%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 7.802%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 7.45335%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 60.4459%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Dimension</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Reach</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Impact</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Rational</th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh"><strong>Score</strong></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">6</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">7</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh"><strong>Client</strong></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">6</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">7</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p><strong>User Experience</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"afe9a016-aaae-43cf-ae54-a6a2864c800a">Reduced login friction (singl=
e authentication)</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"e3cf47fb-6a23-4d8d-9a16-09257a25f084">Faster and more intuitive nav=
igation across applications</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh"><strong>Financial</strong></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">1</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">3</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Cost saving may come from Operational efficiency and platform a=
doption.</p>
         <p><strong>Platform Adoption</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"e3df1927-43e3-4b00-8c85-d79a07a6e033">Increased usage of Compass as=
 the unified platform, driving up revenue&nbsp;</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"73a706c0-652e-4381-abc1-3f87710c33a0">Reduced reliance on legacy po=
rtals; eventually, cutting costs on legacy portal maintenance</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh"><strong>Risk</strong></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">4</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">7</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p><strong>Security &amp; Compliance</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"148c1242-0970-46f7-9f00-1730bb229d66">Stronger authentication (MFA =
via IDP)</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"00c7a1be-cac5-4bd7-81a4-2945ec03d67e">Centralized auditability and =
control</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"988bb774-5ca9-4005-8a53-f6563ad565bb">Reduced dependency on legacy =
credential systems</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh"><strong>Employee</strong></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">1</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">3</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p><strong>Operational Efficiency</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"7688fecd-f6dc-483f-b0e2-3687fcd81414">Reduced manual provisioning e=
ffort</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"19020ef9-efbd-4500-a8ec-e26dd081bf20">Fewer access-related issues a=
nd support tickets</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-TargetAudience">Target Aud=
ience</h2>
    <h3 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-PrimaryPersonas(Directuser=
softhefeature)"><strong>Primary Personas (Direct users of the feature)</str=
ong></h3>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"41d91e40-506e-4fb8-b94d-be05f509b468">This group care=
s most about <strong>experience and reliability</strong>=E2=80=94they shoul=
d never feel the complexity of identity + provisioning behind the scenes.</=
li>
    </ul>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 74.6391%;">
