         <p>External Users&nbsp;</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"bf5f46ba-4709-42f2-b5c9-6574dd2aa753">Advisor / End User</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"bab1c201-d581-4ff1-ab4d-aebc7d9cfbe6">Power User (multi-app / multi=
-role users)</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"5fa1d9ec-30e4-4671-9432-cae548951b4e">Firm Operations User (non-tra=
ding / admin functions within SZ apps)</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"e6123d04-7b0a-42a3-8c47-fb826ca0b967">Access all=
 required SZ applications through a <strong>single platform (Compass)</stro=
ng></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"5f8cc102-5528-4efc-982e-244e5478d43b">Avoid mult=
iple logins and credential management</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"17867f0a-c7d1-493c-9c87-4ee4177d6da3">Quickly na=
vigate to the correct application without friction</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a9885a53-38ea-4aa3-9b2a-ccb09aa6b448">Ensure rel=
iable access to perform daily tasks (trading, servicing, reporting)</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p><span style=3D"font-weight: 600;letter-spacing: -0.003em;">Acce=
ss Provisioning</span></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"39e33878-bbb5-4d5e-be94-1361271ece6e">Be provisioned correctly <str=
ong>before first use</strong></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"07dbc9dc-1ca5-433f-bbfc-4638497e0141">No need to understand backend=
 identity complexity (CX ID vs SZ ID)</li>
         </ul>
         <h4 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-Authentication">Authe=
ntication</h4>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"979cddf3-07a5-4b51-b16a-1efe1f954883">One login (SSO) with no repea=
ted password entry</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"255d202c-1865-4ac2-9dd1-2725572150ec">Secure login experience (alig=
