    <p><br></p>
    <h3 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-SecondaryPersonas(Operatio=
nalUsers)"><strong>Secondary Personas (Operational Users)</strong></h3>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"13d3bb0c-ee98-4b8a-a394-58d5556ea85f">
      <p>This group cares most about <strong>control, accuracy, and efficie=
ncy</strong>=E2=80=94they are the biggest lever to reduce operational cost.=
</p></li>
    </ul>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 75.5674%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 13.076%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 20.9253%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 28.8305%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 37.1683%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Personas</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Sub-personas</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">User Goals</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">User Needs</th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">ID Administrators&nbsp;</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"2a289273-faa7-482b-8f10-aa9de222f43d">SAA team (=
day-to-day user setup)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"16a3bc92-0412-44f2-a288-515a534d5ba0">Access Con=
trol Admin (managing entitlements / feature packages)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"98582a3c-5c84-461d-8b0f-5335110cbd91"><span styl=
e=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Product Activation team (onboarding firm users=
 in bulk and new features)</span></li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
