    <h1 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-FeatureScope">Feature Scop=
e</h1>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-InScope"><span style=3D"fo=
nt-size: 20.0px;letter-spacing: -0.008em;">In Scope</span></h2>
    <p>This feature delivers a complete access lifecycle capability:</p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
      <colgroup>
       <col>
       <col>
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Stage</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Capability Delivered</th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Provisioning</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Identity linking + package-based access<=
/td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Authentication</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Secure, centralized SSO</td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">App Access</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Unified navigation + entitlement enforce=
ment</td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Deprovisioning</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Controlled access removal + auditability=
</td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
