     <li data-uuid=3D"644e9db8-819b-4933-95e1-6f8f340e92b3">Decommissioning=
 of legacy SZ access (handled separately)</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-KeyAssumptions">Key Assump=
tions</h2>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"3df92e0b-855f-4ae9-bda9-1fef5638a54f">
      <p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">External users authenticate=
 via enterprise IDP (e.g., Okta)</span></p></li>
     <li class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwo=
l" data-uuid=3D"b510d0dc-2c65-4298-873c-fefb497c5cf8">Each user has a valid=
 SZ ID available for linking</li>
     <li class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f1iaxwo=
l" data-uuid=3D"d03da1f4-a1b7-4f9f-ba25-d4628235b695">Compass serves as the=
&nbsp;<strong>authoritative system</strong> for:=20
      <ul>
       <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uui=
d=3D"4ee8a9e5-71ac-449d-a56a-c05ee3fcce9a">Authentication entry point</li>
       <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uui=
d=3D"ed4851b2-59ef-4ce2-8733-56fcc7091bf9">Identity mapping</li>
       <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uui=
d=3D"75d0df0b-647d-47ed-9cbd-119e232a0a3a">Access provisioning via Compass =
(Navigation)</li>
      </ul></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"c8d5ff0a-0626-4297-b1a6-0a551a661420">SZ applications=
:=20
      <ul>
       <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uui=
d=3D"520bd381-9dba-438b-9d8b-2a10488e9bbc">Support SSO integration</li>
       <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-uui=
d=3D"48cfc14c-772a-4550-9891-ad0489a27c87">Enforce access based on SZ profi=
le driven entitlements</li>
      </ul></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"35853b4c-ca33-4d22-9849-e59b85c8a19a">Feature package=
s define SZ app access as the primary model</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"aead1bb3-774d-489d-a51e-270f7fc136a9">Direct SZ login=
 will be gradually deprecated</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-FeatureDependencies">Featu=
re Dependencies</h2>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"a42e97ce-f0a5-416d-a2a7-26fd79e7e80f">Identity provid=
er (Okta / external IAM)</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"b1fc52dc-012a-4800-81c9-170ab0592dba">Identity mappin=
g services (CX ID =E2=86=94 SZ ID)</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"522eeae1-5d9c-41ba-a6f0-6b45793a26df">SZ app readines=
s for SSO integration</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"c4ae320f-55e8-48a9-ab1d-beddfd995ea7">
      <p>Compass user administration tool</p></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"c91c2945-bf48-425a-b37f-241c29139cb1">Feature packagi=
ng / entitlement model</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"f9a44752-4c5f-48ea-973a-239e8014a991">Operational:&nb=
sp;=20
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"1660d83f-de67-4af4-8976-cdc0f6f509a4">
        <p>ID Admin processes for provisioning</p></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"d5b93ad1-747d-4603-b6b4-8e84999847ea">
        <p>Support model alignment for new flows</p></li>
      </ul></li>
    </ul>
    <h1 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-FeatureRequirements"><span=
 style=3D"font-size: 24.0px;letter-spacing: -0.01em;"><br>
       Feature Requirements</span></h1>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 1236.0px;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 180.0px;">
       <col style=3D"width: 1055.0px;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th colspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTh">
         <h2 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-1-SSOSZAppsviaCompass=
(externalonly)">1 - SSO SZ Apps via Compass (external only)</h2></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Phasing</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-success">N=
OW</span></p>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Problems to Solve</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <p><u><strong>Major problems:</strong></u></p>
         <p><strong>1. Fragmented authentication experience</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"af3e6ac2-b521-4e4d-be4c-24b9a7a4e683">External users must authentic=
ate separately into SecureZone (SZ) apps using SZ credentials.=20
           <ul>
            <li data-uuid=3D"2b14363a-4d1b-47d9-bd24-39b5b40b0084">The curr=
ent R2 EPM solution which allows users to "store" their SZ credentials is a=
 "hack"; it doesn't streamline user password management.</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" dat=
a-uuid=3D"60f95a1c-4b16-479a-ad85-db617d30315b">This creates <strong>multip=
le login points and inconsistent session behavior</strong>, reducing usabil=
ity and adoption.</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"b7e23f58-09f2-4fe0-bfc7-2fe4411311b6">It poses weak security postur=
e &amp; compliance gaps:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" dat=
a-uuid=3D"3ef243e2-6061-4c56-b681-153b3a2b7146">Direct SZ logins rely on le=
gacy credential models (e.g., no MFA or inconsistent policies).</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" dat=
a-uuid=3D"7160430f-3b2a-495e-b788-84f0560f0177">Authentication is not align=
ed with enterprise IAM (Okta / Compass identity).</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>2. Identity and access fragmentation</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"b393614b-35cb-4677-8260-9dba7b305c6a">Users may have:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mul=
tiple SZ IDs</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Sep=
arate Compass identities</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"d4dfd102-965d-432b-abd1-95ed5798a2d5">Lack of unified identity lead=
s to:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Acc=
ess inconsistencies</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Dif=
ficult user lifecycle management</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Lim=
ited auditability</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>3. Poor navigation &amp; platform experience</strong></=
p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"350f32e5-0562-46ad-b268-37e4dcef9bb2">Users must access SZ apps via=
 separate portals or direct URLs=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" dat=
a-uuid=3D"1f5f41be-bdfc-40bd-b84c-d5999364998b">The pseudo direct SZ app ac=
cess via Legacy Compass hinders the adoption of New Compass</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"e2d09b89-b872-4395-91b7-c1bed7c09388">No unified entry point or con=
textual navigation</li>
         </ul>
         <p><br></p>
         <p><u><strong>Minor problems:</strong></u></p>
         <p><strong>4. Operational inefficiencies</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"8acac78a-e266-4003-bc96-ea72591d467c">Manual onboarding, linking, a=
nd troubleshooting of SZ access</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"1e75b92f-983d-4a3c-aa42-d49aa3623e6c">High dependency on support te=
ams (SAA / Ops)</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"d985ea4b-d375-4d6d-9387-ec83fd7bc600">Complex and error-prone acces=
s request&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Target Users</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul style=3D"text-align: left;">
          <li data-uuid=3D"856ecda9-8592-4233-a02d-774014cf74f9"><span>NBIN=
 clients, including&nbsp;</span>
           <ul style=3D"text-align: left;">
            <li data-uuid=3D"77b508e7-94fb-4938-a8ab-27d33f6d1303"><span>Co=
mpass native users who are authenticated via Compass login page</span></li>
            <li data-uuid=3D"369a2079-405c-4d95-ad36-09eee48355a9"><span>Cl=
ient IDP (SSO) users who are authenticated via their system portal, e.g. iA=
 portal - clients must access via Compass, there will be an integration bet=
ween SZ apps and the client portal.</span></li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Requirements</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><strong>1. SSO Authentication</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"aea5f3e6-3bd0-49c7-aded-0886614c5ec7">Users shall authenticate int=
o Compass via external identity provider (e.g., Okta).</li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"bd323723-8a94-43b2-9900-a1e4924cc45b">Upon launching an SZ app fro=
m Compass:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Th=
e system shall generate and pass a <strong>valid SSO token (e.g., SAML/OAut=
h)</strong>.</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Th=
e target SZ app shall accept the token and grant access without re-authenti=
cation.</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>2. Centralized Entry Point</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"2882b23b-d9f9-4763-877c-b4ce172b2839">All in-scoped SZ apps must b=
e:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Di=
scoverable through Compass UI (Tools / Apps / contextual entry points).</li=
>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"cc0bf458-19ad-4ba1-bef9-66fabff9bea5">Users shall not require dire=
ct SZ URLs.</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>3. Session Management &amp; Logout Redirect <span styl=
e=3D"color:#c9372c;">- tbc</span></strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"3d1b1e6d-1f6f-4c27-bbbc-eb4d67bfa715">Compass session shall be the=
 <strong>primary session driver</strong>.</li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"578e17b4-51b1-4e18-a8aa-01781e7e7bab">SZ app session behavior:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mu=
st align with Compass session lifecycle (token validity / expiry). <strong>=
<span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">- tbc, how?</span></strong></li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mu=
st <u>not</u> redirect users to SZ login page. <span style=3D"color:#c9372c=
;">- where does it go to?</span></li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>4. Identity Mapping (External Users)</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"06d01944-fb39-44e9-9085-ca7385d3a705">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">Each Compass user must be mapped to an SZ identity (SZ ID).</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" da=
ta-uuid=3D"a28b5e20-5a0d-40e1-bae8-86f7de372e84"><u>Exception: </u>Compass =
user does not have access to any SZ apps including Servicing (SOMA) via Com=
pass.</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"6386ee4c-826f-4c68-869e-ff39a9b38f78">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">System shall support:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">1:=
1 mapping (baseline requirement), single users</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Ex=
tension for multi-ID scenarios, multi-firm users</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"ed0f9d8d-0070-4248-acd1-8ec202b6138b">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">Mapping must be:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Pe=
rsisted (e.g., via ICR / UAMA)</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Ac=
cessible for validation</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>5. Access Control Enforcement</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"bab8d7f3-d7a7-4583-bd80-6b25929cc786">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">Access to SZ apps must be driven by:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Co=
mpass user profile (user package/role)</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Fi=
rm context</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">En=
titlement model (access matrix)</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"e6e2ed9c-37e5-46a0-8856-3543e50da983">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">SZ apps must enforce:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Au=
thorization based on identity claims (e.g., roles, firm scope) and SZ profi=
le driven entitlements</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>6. User Provisioning (External)</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"54950018-1701-4ef9-af09-023bd7886621">When a user first accesses a=
n SZ app via Compass:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Sy=
stem may trigger <strong>Just-In-Time (JIT) provisioning</strong> or valida=
tion</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"904ccbaa-04a1-412e-9948-6ebb571b3ac7">If mapping or profile is inc=
omplete:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Us=
er is shown a controlled error and support flow</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>7. Error Handling</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"7b863bc8-73c6-4243-adb4-869baa81d176">If SSO fails:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Us=
er must <u>not</u> be redirected to SZ login</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Sy=
stem must display:=20
              <ul>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
Clear error state</li>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
Support instructions</li>
              </ul></li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>8. Navigation &amp; Context Passing</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"7a7682a6-0fbe-46b7-86af-d19b74c6d144">System should support:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Di=
rect access into SZ apps from Compass</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Pa=
ssing contextual attributes, whatever applicable (e.g. source platform, fir=
m context)&nbsp;=20
              <ul>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" =
style=3D"font-weight: bold;" data-uuid=3D"ac2f277b-88de-4bc4-887e-9347ccebb=
158"><strong>Language (EN/FR) must be passed from Compass to SZ apps (eithe=
r via profile update or context passing)</strong></li>
              </ul></li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><s><strong><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">9. User Export repor=
t - out-of-scope</span></strong></s></p>
          <ul>
           <li style=3D"color:#172b4d;" data-uuid=3D"dd1fc1c7-7b7d-44b0-a88=
c-1d6ae75caefb"><s><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Currently, the SZ Id data=
 point is sourced from Okta, the <em>bngfSecureZoneId </em>claim. Though it=
's not the source-of-truth, it will be synchronized for clients (external u=
sers) every time their linked SZ Id is updated; however, it will be blanked=
 out for all employees after the employee SSO launch.</span></s>
            <ul>
             <li style=3D"color:#172b4d;" data-uuid=3D"2c73be7d-01b1-414d-9=
7f7-f513c283d9e7"><s><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">If no change is made, g=
oing forward, the SZ Id on the report will <u>not</u> be available for inte=
rnal users (NBIN and COR firm code).</span></s></li>
             <li style=3D"color:#172b4d;" data-uuid=3D"78f330d4-6f12-4ebc-a=
0a0-d4265fe92691"><s><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">If it is changed to sou=
rce the data via UAMA, the SZ Id on the report will be available for both e=
xternal and internal users.</span></s></li>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"3dbabeb7-5cae-4b7b-bafb-7fe2a36f72c3"><s><em>Fo=
r </em>change arguments:</s>
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"f7edb890-0902-4732-b748-ec03c9d54b2b"><s>The =
user export report provides a snapshot of all linked system Ids (SZ, R2, OS=
S), user status and user assignments; a good tool for user analysis and tro=
uble-shooting.</s></li>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"54d9def6-9dac-4231-91fa-733c572d88d7"><s><span =
style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><em>Against </em>change arguments:&nbsp;</span></s=
>
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"800d3b45-17f3-4652-8689-706c848b4674"><s>The =
SZ Id, together with other user identity data columns, are not editable via=
 bulk user update</s></li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"4ab87380-6555-41d5-9609-4d40c63e9eef"><s>Ther=
e is not dependency on user attestation for internal users because the&nbsp=
; internal user certification is done in IIQ</s></li>
            </ul></li>
           <li style=3D"color:#c9372c;" data-uuid=3D"01242381-a508-4a0c-af9=
f-35510b5620c6"><s><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><u><strong>Decision makin=
g</strong></u>:</span></s>
            <ul>
             <li style=3D"color:#c9372c;" data-uuid=3D"c3425b15-b3f5-4f02-9=
2b9-2ca20feac257"><s><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">Feasibility check: Can =
it be done? - Tech feasibility check to confirm</span></s></li>
             <li style=3D"color:#c9372c;" data-uuid=3D"cb11fdc8-0e0d-433e-b=
796-edb2958e237c"><s><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">User needs: Is there a =
need? - Check with stakeholders, including prod activation/support</span></=
s></li>
             <li style=3D"color:#c9372c;" data-uuid=3D"aad7d416-c849-4a8e-a=
d83-8d7589da6040"><s><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">Final decision to be ma=
de</span></s></li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><stron=
g>10. Single-entry access via Compass - in-scope</strong><br></span></p>
          <ul>
           <li style=3D"color:#c9372c;" data-uuid=3D"7da20a07-996d-47cc-8d6=
1-23b99ffafd1a">SZ app access for NBIN clients must be through Compass</li>
           <li style=3D"font-style: italic;color:#c9372c;" data-uuid=3D"0fd=
59e77-44fa-4376-b24e-a47e12b7a7ed"><em><span>NBIN client users can be flagg=
ed and given a </span><span>nbin</span><span> scope in their token for any =
given app they are accessing. That scope would be the marker in SZ Apps tri=
ggering the validation of the reception of a signed message from CX, confir=
ming the user indeed comes from CX and not directly.</span></em></li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Non-Functionals</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <p><strong>1. Security</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"d00b6247-8045-4301-baa7-717af6c85bdc">Must comply with enterprise I=
AM standards:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">MFA=
 enforced via IDP</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Tok=
en-based authentication (no credential sharing)</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"98e266ef-933e-4573-b3f8-3f2722ec31f9">Must eliminate direct SZ cred=
ential usage.</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>2. Performance</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"d7d86528-bfe7-4916-a8d0-73a165cf7906">App launch via SSO should occ=
ur within acceptable UX tolerance (no noticeable delay from user perspectiv=
e).</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>3. Availability &amp; Reliability</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"28a0226c-0957-48c7-b877-5f75c3b0c188">SSO flows must be resilient:=
=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Gra=
ceful degradation if downstream app unavailable</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">No =
cascading failures to Compass login</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>4. Scalability</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"d8eb7892-342f-4c20-91ea-b9ea77e0a9fa">Must support:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">All=
 external firms</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">All=
 in-scoped SZ apps (phased rollout)</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>5. Audit &amp; Compliance</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"93923fc7-f1b5-40b0-925e-222936f92801">System must:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Log=
 authentication events</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Tra=
ck access to SZ apps</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Sup=
port audit reporting through centralized identity</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>6. Usability</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"d0254b8b-b9c9-47ce-b49b-d9ef1f707b38">Experience must:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Rem=
ove duplicate login prompts</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Be =
consistent across all SZ apps</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"0af30ef5-8828-4e5e-9ea7-8a4697aa8932">Must follow Compass UX standa=
rds</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>7. Compatibility</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"ebc73918-c31c-430d-92f3-598bf9833c9f">Must integrate with:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Okt=
a (external IDP)</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Exi=
sting SZ app architecture</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Out of Scope</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"23b41af8-06c3-403d-8385-3f42d3b843fd">Internal e=
mployee SSO (handled by separate initiative)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"5b0c3a7b-7240-4022-8a9b-bffa858b0b7e">Full role/=
permission mapping within SZ applications</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"69bb0674-0439-403a-8bc2-4ed2109ac9c8">Migration =
or redesign of SZ app business logic</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"9c46e116-dd5b-4373-a4a2-76ebf8c37e62">Decommissi=
oning legacy Compass apps, SZ direct URL or login route (handled by feature=
 activation &amp; deactivation in GTM strategy), including but not limited =
to:=20
           <ul>
            <li data-uuid=3D"d8a5d230-d601-4434-a595-960a472a7d0c">Disablin=
g R2 EPM</li>
            <li data-uuid=3D"79ca844b-d225-4cc3-85ab-5eff91e28078">Dismantl=
e the <em>Launch App link </em>in R2&nbsp;</li>
            <li data-uuid=3D"da8a9a8b-7ec1-44f1-9b71-37242d030ae5">Resettin=
g SZ user passwords for clients&nbsp;</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"e1320df9-2301-45e4-90e3-1d8f7e6202ea">Advanced m=
ulti-identity (multi-SZ ID) resolution (initial phase)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"631ad10f-4d0e-4e6b-aac0-85c08c45c991">Non-SSO in=
tegration types (e.g., API-based deep integration)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"5ad8c555-f9a6-436c-bd57-3f81ae3fa467"><span>Syst=
em users who are authenticated via system-to-system API authentication</spa=
n></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Acceptance Criteria</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd"><strong style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">1. Authentication</strong>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"b47ac2d2-a776-44b6-9214-c1f7c75ef5c1">User logs into Compass and ac=
cesses an SZ app without entering additional credentials=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" dat=
a-uuid=3D"5177efb2-c365-4e92-89d2-dbf91789f6b9">Both Compass native users a=
nd SSO users must be able to be authenticated to SZ apps via Compass.</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>2. Navigation</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"a1a9dc03-f276-400d-ac13-f5fc27e3a46d">User launches SZ app from Com=
pass and lands directly in the app (no SZ login page)</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>3. Identity</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"54c3d28f-ffa6-4a9d-be24-67702de83cab">User identity is correctly re=
cognized in SZ app based on Compass mapping</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>4. Session <span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">- tbc</span><=
/strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"07ffc60b-c24c-4f6e-bab4-942c61aaf287">Session expires consistently =
(user is not left active in SZ after Compass expiry)</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"a872f9c2-3c05-4b7f-a807-9cb8d4823cfa">Never get redirected to SZ lo=
gin page&nbsp;</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>5. Error Handling</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"6f40285c-7e99-4806-9e5a-f84ebfce3698">Failed SSO attempts display c=
lear error and do not redirect to SZ login</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>6. Access Control</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"7ab0c880-8eb5-4103-b8e4-ee94a62edd88">Users can only access apps th=
ey are entitled to via Compass</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>7. Context passing</strong>&nbsp;<span style=3D"color:#=
c9372c;">- in-scope</span></p>
         <ul>
          <li>Language (EN/FR) is passed from Compass to SZ apps&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Dependencies</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"72a90caa-af73-4802-97b2-d468e36fe466">Migration =
of in-scoped SZ apps</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"eadbd19d-709c-4d81-aea0-e1bdb47cd6eb">Applicatio=
n Status (how to handle unavailable app status)=20
           <ul>
            <li data-uuid=3D"585780e3-ef16-4017-ba32-86d86f224865">Dependin=
g on the email notification dev</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Risks &amp; Constraints</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <p><strong>1. Identity Complexity</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"d1436464-424c-47da-8017-4a5a459c4865">Users with multiple SZ IDs or=
 cross-firm setups introduce mapping complexity</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>2. Inconsistent SZ App Capabilities</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"a0597fd3-124e-4165-936c-db2c89f38ef5">Not all SZ apps may:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Sup=
port SSO standards</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Han=
dle tokens uniformly</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>3. Session Coupling Limitations</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"666ea061-bdc9-4aa2-b930-139ef657af0d">SAML-based SSO ties sessions =
together:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Exp=
iry behavior may not be fully controllable</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>4. Dependencies</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"95829fe6-ea9e-4731-8224-b9301716a12d">Okta / IDP configuration</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"74b1e1fe-0c33-4704-88b3-ba5736479813">SZ app integration readiness<=
/li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"14addb7f-8593-42fe-a096-ee4567e16732">User identity mapping service=
s (ICR / UAMA)</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>5. Operational Readiness</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"a00f56dd-a92f-488b-abc4-285b112ed3da">Support teams must adapt to:=
=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">New=
 flows</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Err=
or handling models</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Red=
uced direct control</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Key Assumptions</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"f93e1471-4b56-4273-8eaa-d2ccbdb73ca9">External u=
sers authenticate via <strong>Okta-based IDP</strong></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a70e0572-d1ec-44df-9a74-ec91b7b8ed67">Each user =
has (or can be linked to) a valid SZ ID</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"2d321a8b-abb2-4dfe-b078-7edc4acaffda">SZ apps wi=
ll adopt/enable SSO integration protocols</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a91c37bb-698f-4128-b246-7b049f05105b">Compass is=
 the <strong>single entry point for all in-scoped SZ app access</strong></l=
i>
          <li data-uuid=3D"aade2fb5-67b1-45a0-9fd5-9532cc21be89">Direct SZ =
login, either via SZ login page or the <em>Launch app link</em> in Legacy C=
ompass,&nbsp;will be deprecated over time</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"393219e4-ff8d-4d0a-8af4-85e0a1d3eaac">Identity m=
apping between Compass and SZ is authoritative and maintained</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Open Questions :question:&nbsp;</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"bd536c73-8441-46ae-a7a6-0b86e357a16c">Any <stro=
ng>session sync </strong>requirement?<strong>&nbsp;<span style=3D"color:#c9=
372c;">- tbc</span></strong>
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"097e9d44-e010-4e9a-a31a-e88a6519de3c">Check w=
ith Mahdi how the session mgmt. work, is it feasible/ideal to sync with Com=
pass session? - <a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-username=
=3D"piej002" href=3D"/display/~piej002" data-linked-resource-id=3D"11334458=
09" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"userinf=
o" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca">Joseph-Pascal Pierre</a>&nbsp;</li=
>
            </ul></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"1a92928a-34bf-4c03-a04b-cb0850d514fd">How to fl=
ag and manage <strong>application status</strong>, not in R2 but in CX? e.g=
. hide or grey out the SZ app link when the app is flagged as unavailable? =
- <u style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Out-of-scope:</u> <span style=3D"lett=
er-spacing: 0.0px;">not to be solved in the initial phase (MVP)</span></li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"c671fc56-de3c-493d-8811-9af52e362c0d">Can all S=
Z apps support <strong>multi-SZ Id</strong>? - yes, based on Madhi's reply,=
 the integration supports a SZ Id switcher=20
            <ul>
             <li style=3D"font-weight: bold;" data-uuid=3D"be8eeb51-944e-4a=
0a-a36c-d5f64a8cfc21"><strong>TO-DO: Ask Delivery to open a Jira ticket to =
do a feasibility test as soon as possible. <span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">-=
 pending for Dev action</span></strong></li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 1239.0px;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 180.0px;">
       <col style=3D"width: 1058.0px;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th colspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTh">
         <h2 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-2-SZAppAccessProvisio=
ning(Single&amp;Bulk)">2 - SZ App Access Provisioning (Single &amp; Bulk)</=
h2></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Phasing</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-success">N=
OW</span></p>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Problems to Solve</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <p><strong>1. Disconnected identity model between CX and SZ</stron=
g></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"b32475cd-aeae-487f-929f-baa454ceb871">User identities exist separat=
ely in:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Com=
pass (CX ID)</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Sec=
ureZone (SZ ID)</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"a768ee2b-ddaf-49b8-a7de-cc791e80d25a">There is no centralized mecha=
nism to:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Lin=
k identities</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mai=
ntain consistent mappings</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p>=E2=9E=A1=EF=B8=8F This leads to fragmented access control and =
inconsistent user experiences across SZ apps.</p>
         <p><strong>2. Manual, error-prone provisioning processes</strong><=
/p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"d6d2b0ce-ad1a-4ea5-8fe2-398a896903cb">SZ app access requires:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Man=
ual updates across systems</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mul=
tiple operational steps (SAA / Ops involvement)</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"5e4a3200-2154-4e4b-90b8-e19203d35fd5">High risk of:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Inc=
orrect access assignments</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mis=
sing identity links</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p>=E2=9E=A1=EF=B8=8F Current onboarding flows require multiple st=
eps and teams, increasing operational overhead and errors.</p>
         <p><strong>3. Lack of centralized access management</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"e84eddf5-74f6-47b9-a794-15d847cfc41f">SZ app entitlements are:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Not=
 managed through Compass</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Not=
 aligned with feature packaging strategy</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"52546ed4-a6d5-4851-af4e-cde42ef1a288">No unified place for ID Admin=
s to:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Ass=
ign app access</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Man=
age entitlements</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>4. Inconsistent access provisioning model</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"128e29a6-189a-4ee3-9e4a-10729bf58e67">Access is not standardized ac=
ross:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Fir=
ms</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">App=
lications</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"63af6c0e-db6a-467e-9b60-641ff1b40bce">Difficult to scale or automat=
e provisioning logic</li>
         </ul>
         <p>=E2=9E=A1=EF=B8=8F Broader FUM challenges highlight inconsisten=
t feature assignment across firms impacting onboarding and support.</p>
         <p><strong>5. Limited scalability for future SSO model</strong></p=
>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"04954c92-d009-4c69-85fd-507e124ee8f5">SSO relies on:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Acc=
urate identity mapping (CX =E2=86=94 SZ)</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Pre=
-defined entitlements</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"b5316b3e-7396-4660-a02a-d548c1386ea5">Without centralized provision=
ing:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">SSO=
 experience breaks or requires fallback flows</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Target Users</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul style=3D"text-align: left;">
          <li data-uuid=3D"bea4f40c-5b50-4557-ae8a-012ffab055fb"><span>Firm=
 Security Steward (parent or child)</span></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"dfcd00a7-3607-4c54-b08f-c374475c3310">NBC ID Adm=
in teams</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"206230cc-6ac2-4847-a94c-4531ef50ac3f">Product Ac=
tivation teams</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Requirements</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p>Unless specified otherwise, the followings shall be applied to=
 the <strong>Single user create/update tool </strong>as well as the <strong=
>Bulk user update tool</strong>.</p>
          <p><strong>1. Identity Linking (CX ID =E2=86=94 SZ ID)</strong></=
p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"10af275d-eec0-45e6-823c-dbd0d45d73f4">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">ID Administrators shall be able to:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Li=
nk a Compass user (CX ID) to an SZ ID via the Compass user admin tool</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"c6c9ee94-c2d1-4fc6-9a48-bc41cc50cbe3">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">System shall:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Va=
lidate that the SZ ID exists</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Pr=
event duplicate or conflicting mappings=20
              <ul>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" =
data-uuid=3D"0bac233f-8216-4a73-871d-bb94b18405f4">CX:SZ is 1:m (but 1 SZ I=
D cannot be linked to multiple CX ID)</li>
              </ul></li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"516a9eab-4621-4a81-a688-6a17929d2ef4">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">Mapping must be:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Pe=
rsisted in a centralized identity store (e.g., ICR / UAMA)</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Re=
trievable for SSO and access validation</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li>Good to have:=20
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"4935eeb1-3a03-4cd8-865b-4ac390e95a31">Depict =
the SZ first name and last name on CX when the SZ ID is provided, for valid=
ation purpose</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>2. User Provisioning Workflow</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"3961b734-a60b-4f4d-ba74-406b1e46df97">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">ID Administrators shall be able to:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Cr=
eate or update user profiles in Compass and in Security App (for SZ Id) sep=
arately</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">As=
sign SZ ID during provisioning or post-creation</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"39834f0e-e849-49e1-a41b-ecfa995eaca8">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">Workflow shall support:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Cr=
eate + Link (new users)</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Li=
nk only (existing users)</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Up=
date / change mapping</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>3. SZ App Access Assignment&nbsp;</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"631ebd3b-19d8-4e07-8599-cce7cb7cdaf0">ID Administrators shall be a=
ble to:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">As=
sign SZ app access to users from Compass and Security App (separately)</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p>:warning: <strong>Coarse-grained access control (SZ app access=
) is supported by UAMA, however, it is opted out in the Compass integration=
. ID Admin will access provision the SZ user profile in Security App and ma=
nage user assignment in Compass via feature packages for every app access r=
equest (create / update).</strong></p>
          <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-emb=
edded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"fa=
lse" height=3D"189" src=3D"0c113a6ef37d4c29ec3199303e918025aff17766e52e7dd8=
d5bf64edeee81a83" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/2577262338/image-=
2026-7-9_10-8-26.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1783606106483&amp;a=
pi=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"279=
5406632" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"at=
tachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2026-7-9_10-8-26.png"=
 data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D=
"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2577262338" data-linked-re=
source-container-version=3D"39" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></spa=
n></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"d08b8ee8-29bd-4679-b621-b74fc0d893a2">Access assignment shall:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Be=
 tied to <strong>feature packages</strong> (see #4 below)</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Be=
 enforced consistently across all integrated apps</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>4. Feature Packaging Integration</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"4ae5b2fd-fcfe-4f27-a15c-6e2ffca8fd97">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">SZ app access provisioning shall be:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Bu=
ndled into <strong>user feature packages</strong></li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"2cd43a86-9046-4856-ae4c-d1b3fb87621f">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">Two types of packages supported:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf"><s=
trong>Core Features</strong>
              <ul>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
Included by default for eligible users</li>
              </ul></li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf"><s=
trong>Add-On Features</strong>
              <ul>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
Optional and assignable per user or firm</li>
              </ul></li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"631597d0-7c2c-415a-8508-6ded99d1b3ea">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">System shall support:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">As=
signing packages to users</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Au=
tomatically inheriting associated SZ app access</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p>=E2=9E=A1=EF=B8=8F This aligns with the product packaging mode=
l where features are grouped and assigned to simplify onboarding and reduce=
 errors.</p>
          <p>:warning: The feature grouping will be finalized during UAR di=
scussion</p>
          <p><strong>5. Entitlement Enforcement</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"0311a392-4aad-4ec3-94dc-3f5006f66dbc">System shall ensure:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">On=
ly users with assigned feature packages can access corresponding SZ apps</l=
i>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"dace01ed-5be1-416b-a1a0-aa636b827a03">Entitlements must be:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Fi=
rm-scoped</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Pr=
ofile-driven</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>6. Validation and Error Handling</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"4d07dbb9-cac3-4322-98f5-9a661ad9649e">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">System shall validate:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">SZ=
 ID format and existence</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Co=
mpatibility of access assignments</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Re=
quired preconditions (e.g., linked identity)</li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"79e68a65-67c6-4243-bd9c-b8e128e52cec">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">Error scenarios:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mi=
ssing SZ ID =E2=86=92 block access assignment</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">In=
valid mapping =E2=86=92 prevent save</li>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Co=
nflicting assignments =E2=86=92 display actionable error</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>7. Visibility and Auditability</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"ab125c7a-8361-483e-9eee-047bcf483412">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">ID Administrators shall be able to:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Vi=
ew current:=20
              <ul>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
CX ID =E2=86=94 SZ ID mapping</li>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
Assigned SZ apps / feature packages</li>
              </ul></li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"7e8dc0ff-ffda-40f7-814e-521c0ebcf386">
            <p class=3D"paragraph-in-scc-markdown-text ___1ngh792 ftgm304 f=
1iaxwol">System shall:</p>
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Lo=
g all provisioning actions:=20
              <ul>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
Create</li>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
Link</li>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
Update</li>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
Remove access</li>
              </ul></li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>8. Deprovisioning / Access Updates</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"630f34c7-9ba1-4527-9036-97a70d5d08f5">System shall support:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Re=
moving SZ app access when:=20
              <ul>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
Feature package removed</li>
               <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">=
User deactivated</li>
              </ul></li>
            </ul></li>
           <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data=
-uuid=3D"cc4ff4a3-eed3-4ef3-a293-6551dd0fdfdd">Changes must:=20
            <ul>
             <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Pr=
opagate to SZ apps via integration mechanisms</li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Non-Functionals</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <p><strong>1. Security</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"b23efccc-e0e1-4ee7-8a3a-1bcff0ecfc86">Only authorized ID Administra=
tors may:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Lin=
k identities</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Ass=
ign SZ app access</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"af28a8d1-7f7a-44fc-a23b-c8bc8eca1c9f">All changes must:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Be =
authenticated and auditable</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>2. Data Integrity</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"d2106a11-68d4-47ba-8fcd-740cb592ab73">Identity mapping must:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mai=
ntain 1:1 consistency (initial phase)</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Pre=
vent data corruption or orphaned mappings</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>3. Performance</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"7a7c9aec-806b-4889-9569-d19633b0d506">Provisioning actions (linking=
, assigning access) should:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Exe=
cute within acceptable admin workflow time</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"9ad4a7f7-ac98-4f21-888a-0bf01f8817b4">No noticeable lag in UI updat=
e or save actions</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>4. Scalability</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"b2dfa5d5-701e-4638-b5e0-bc115750f070">Must support:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">All=
 firms and external users</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Exp=
ansion to additional SZ apps</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"6d2d84ef-9f3b-4d30-a017-81ffa1f5ae82">Must accommodate:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Gro=
wth in feature packages and access rules</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>5. Audit &amp; Compliance</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"b2bf095c-5b77-4710-9acd-8ca4270fda85">System must maintain:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Ful=
l audit trail of access changes</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"209a9936-1dc7-452d-a201-2f0fcee7c034">Must support:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Com=
pliance reporting and investigations</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>6. Usability (Admin Experience)</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"c3a80408-7e2c-45e8-930e-1e15157ddc7d">UI must:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Be =
intuitive for ID Admins</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Cle=
arly display mapping status and access assignments</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"1d70b731-b0dd-48fa-a3ae-0b7f635f77cb">Must reduce reliance on:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Ext=
ernal tools or manual processes</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>7. Compatibility</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"9525f220-33a6-4f1c-9b95-71ddbc45f601">Must integrate with:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Exi=
sting Compass user management</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Ide=
ntity mapping services (ICR / UAMA)</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">SZ =
app entitlement models</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Out of Scope</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"9b740a58-d01d-4d20-9058-9040d7ea9dbf">Internal e=
mployee provisioning (covered by separate initiatives)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a4d46356-1938-4eb9-b4e6-6904570a439f">Advanced m=
ulti-SZ ID per user handling (future enhancement)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"22ced5cb-01d8-46ad-8e93-b5570f691cf8">Full redes=
ign of SZ app entitlement models</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"935aedb4-157c-4c22-9702-e6b75bc93f6f">Self-servi=
ce provisioning by client firms (future state)</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Acceptance Criteria</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <p><strong>1. Identity Linking</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"65a4fe3b-51e5-4757-bffc-dd94fc56fbd1">ID Admin can successfully lin=
k a CX ID to <u>one or more</u> valid SZ ID, but not one SZ ID to many CX I=
D</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"ee785756-b03a-4305-916d-adfde35d6c4f">System prevents duplicate or =
invalid mappings</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>2. Access Assignment</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"2cfd2d96-69cf-4862-9be4-0a6f3d29925f">ID Admin can assign SZ app ac=
cess via feature packages</li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"c2645e69-6219-4fbb-91ac-3e3210890cae">Assigned access reflects corr=
ect set of SZ applications</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>3. Feature Packaging</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"28f8b5c4-73ba-4f40-9eff-3a8d7ac2cbf5">Assigning a feature package a=
utomatically provisions associated SZ app access=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" dat=
a-uuid=3D"e5612350-e452-4e43-959c-f407bd07749c">Must follow the current enf=
orcement rule about firm-scope and user-scope access</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"4834d786-2208-451a-b172-3f4ca94ec5d2">Removing a package removes co=
rresponding access via Compass (but no direct impact to provisioning in Sec=
urity App)</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>4. Validation&nbsp;</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"828bbfbe-67af-49a4-ac49-00684b15fe34">System blocks access assignme=
nt if SZ ID is missing or invalid <span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">- tbc</spa=
n></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"298f2bdd-ffdd-492e-8658-c08638c1474d">Errors are clear and actionab=
le</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>5. Visibility</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"2e649de1-b178-4c24-8d80-a7ffb3a520aa">ID Admin can view:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Ide=
ntity mapping</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Ass=
igned feature packages</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">SZ =
app access</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>6. Auditability</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"081f7641-e179-4f8f-b0d2-3c9da05ac1fa">All provisioning actions are =
logged and traceable</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>7. Bulk user processing</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"025ae5ec-ac0a-4442-a136-a8a03ea0c6c3">Product us=
ers are able to bulk update external users of their SZ app access by linkin=
g or unlinking their SZ ID, and modifying their SZ app access through featu=
re package assignments. Pre-condition: The coarse-grained and fine-grained =
access of the corresponding SZ Id has been updated in Security App.</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a85a741f-941c-4db9-b07b-0b5d041cd394">All accept=
ance criteria applicable to single user update (via UI) shall be applied to=
 bulk user update, e.g. validation, visibility and auditability.</li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>8. Client IDP (SSO) Users provisioning&nbsp;</strong></=
p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"bc0a755a-20af-4983-b886-41489a1bce16">The featur=
e must be applicable to the current <strong>bulk SSO user create flow </str=
ong>for iA user onboarding.</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3c38d40a-081c-4d1f-8cfd-95b5b5dd21ed">There must=
 not be any disruption to the user administration or SZ app access for SSO =
users.</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Roadmap Dependencies</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"d27bd0e3-2b9c-4133-b545-3e98d5c578af">Compass an=
d UAMA integration</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"023e8307-7110-4c9b-8c62-8a03097fc337">Feature li=
fecycle management - Automation&nbsp;:question:&nbsp;</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"64de4144-6c55-4de1-a617-98aca4018399">Unified Ac=
cess Management, including in-depth user attestation (future): Provide dril=
l-down reports on SZ app access by user&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Risks &amp; Constraints</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <p><u><strong>Constraints:</strong></u></p>
         <p><strong>1. New SZ access model limitation</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li>The model can only handle <strong>coarse-grained</strong> =3D=
&gt; SZ app access <strong>--</strong> <strong>BUT it is not applied to the=
 Compass integration</strong></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"34816391-68fa-4229-b81f-fa7a0fc12fea">The model =
cannot handle <strong>fine-grained</strong> =3D&gt; SZ app feature + Data a=
ccess</li>
         </ul>
         <p><br></p>
         <p><u><strong>Risks:</strong></u></p>
         <p><strong>1. Identity Mapping Complexity</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"6e2b2406-bb02-4aba-9ed0-f524e5d2b677">Users with:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Mul=
tiple SZ IDs</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Cro=
ss-firm relationships</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"12ff8341-5bee-41dc-9cc1-e0669a8360cd">May require:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Fut=
ure enhancements beyond 1:1 mapping</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>2. Dependency on SZ Systems</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"116862a5-d7ed-47a9-ae20-940b6d482b7b">SZ app entitlements may:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Not=
 be fully standardized</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Req=
uire custom integration handling</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>3. Misconfiguration Risk</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"1f8c8908-7fa3-4859-94fa-27c930b3cd01">Incorrect feature package ass=
ignments may:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Gra=
nt excessive access</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Res=
trict required access</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p>=E2=9E=A1=EF=B8=8F Requires strong validation and guardrails.</=
p>
         <p><strong>4. Operational Transition</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"3fbb94ea-1935-4678-b7b9-77728a6d1767">Shift from:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Man=
ual provisioning =E2=86=92 centralized model</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"749e3b65-256f-4f1d-9637-b9f6b2cea949">Requires:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Tra=
ining for ID Admins</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Upd=
ated procedures</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><strong>5. Integration Dependencies</strong></p>
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"44597187-5a8e-4773-91a2-acca09bb5cd5">Depends on:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Ide=
ntity mapping services</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Fea=
ture packaging system maturity</li>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">SZ =
app readiness</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Key Assumptions</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"4c02238f-a718-446c-a87b-38ad224c933f">Each external user will have:=
=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">A v=
alid SZ ID that can be linked to a CX ID, except those who do not access an=
y SZ apps</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"c68cfd6a-6bdf-478e-862e-4c4d06949828">Compass will serve as:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">The=
 authoritative system for user provisioning</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"503852d5-525a-4f1b-bf82-52d606f56dea">Feature packages will:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Def=
ine access to SZ apps (not standalone assignment long-term)</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"bda0c98d-ba32-4904-b366-b7cc6de88025">SZ apps will:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Res=
pect access decisions from Compass-driven entitlements</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf" data-=
uuid=3D"23e57193-01f9-4109-a502-9bc08dfd5cde">Identity mapping infrastructu=
re:=20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"___ccc16d0 fje8fi8 f1ng9h0j f1bwykku f18jd3zf">Exi=
sts and supports persistence and retrieval</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Open Questions :question:&nbsp;</th>
        <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"conflu=
enceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a8103433-bbf7-4a45-9cc5-d1c412362328">How to map=
 each SZ app in the UAMA call? By <strong>new function group code? - to con=
firm with Mahdi if CX controls coarse-grained access via UAMA?<span style=
=3D"color:#c9372c;"> -NO?</span></strong>
           <ul>
            <li data-uuid=3D"ec755fac-d66a-4a14-8d3a-535be6056070"><s><stro=
ng>Assumption: UAMA can update both ID pairing and coarse-grained access, s=
o that it is feasible for CX to control SZ app access without going through=
 Security App&nbsp;</strong></s></li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><em>That means the update user's SZ app access use case is not =
feasible?</em><strong> - Correct</strong></p>
         <p><em>In order to add/drop SZ app access for a CX user, </em><str=
ong>- Correct</strong></p>
         <p><em>(1) SAA will have to update the SZ profile via Security App=
 (add/drop the function group code), AND&nbsp;</em></p>
         <p><em>(2) SAA will have to update the CX profile by switching the=
 user role (if it's a core app) or unselecting the module (if it's an add-o=
n app)</em></p>
         <p><em>Is the above correct? Thanks.</em></p>
         <p><em>And basically, bulk user update is not feasible..</em><stro=
ng> - Not really. It is a 2-step process but workable, just like GIC.</stro=
ng></p>
         <p><br></p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3a435a5b-9b84-49c6-9e09-0d89aa539323">Identity r=
econ &amp; conflict handling: is it feasible to detect dup. SZ id, non-exis=
t SZ id, then escalate or resolve the issue upfront?<span style=3D"color:#c=
9372c;"> - tbc</span></li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <h1 id=3D"PRDCompasstoSecuredZoneIntegration-OperationalImpact&amp;Cons=
iderations"><span style=3D"font-size: 20.0px;letter-spacing: -0.008em;">Ope=
rational Impact &amp; Considerations</span></h1>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 74.2819%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 28.9694%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 71.0306%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Operationalization&nbsp;</=
th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>For SAA team:</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"01d19296-efd9-4a26-8fc9-af2d68d1593f">Clear, new=
 process flow</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"d8b7df07-fb0c-4a77-806a-8ec8b8734332">Revised SA=
A access matrix, if applicable</li>
         </ul>
         <p>For Product Support:</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"155693c1-ee21-46ac-ad11-5ba9e4ea04cf">Feature wa=
lkthrough</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">One-time feature package u=
pdate to align SZ app offerings</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"2825517f-4da4-4668-9ca8-4afe8fdfed4d">Prepare th=
e firm &amp; user packages by bundling SZ apps to eligible packages (core +=
 add-on)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"35ee7103-ce46-4d4b-985c-9a395f9819ba">Update all=
 feature packages with the BAU process</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">User migration: One-time u=
ser assignment update + CX Id to SZ Id linking&nbsp;</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Analysis:</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"47fa4a79-c599-41e9-8c27-e45f0b0938cb">Audit the =
app access assignments of all firm users based on their linked SZ Id and us=
er package assignment&nbsp;</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"518c8503-4c88-4074-9d27-a11e155f7d90">Identify t=
he gap (app access the user should have verse they are currently assigned t=
o)</li>
         </ul>
         <p>Security App:</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"b7887438-31b9-48fa-838f-0ae900b1af4a">Bulk updat=
e the coarse-grained and fine-grained access for each SZ ID of all NBIN cli=
ents</li>
         </ul>
         <p>Compass:</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"7daa1070-931e-45d5-9ef3-b504847779a4">Bulk updat=
e user assignments of all NBIN clients</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"c1d4600d-acfb-47ef-85bb-4503e3fdc311">Update CX =
Id to SZ Id mappings in Okta (via UI or bulk user update tool), if necessar=
y</li>
         </ul>
         <p>SZ new model:&nbsp;</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"52f6970c-e34a-4c1d-8dfa-953bc065f8cc">Persist th=
e CX Id to SZ Id mappings in UAMA/ICR</li>
         </ul>
         <p><u>Prerequisites:</u> SZ account cleanup, new SZ Id creation (f=
or missing ones)</p></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Operational changes / new&=
nbsp;constraints</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"b0d34a84-4177-4cce-ab24-df543b5106fa">Only 1 CX =
ID can be associated with 1 SZ ID (enforced in SZ), but multiple SZ ID's ca=
n be linked to 1 CX ID (within CX user settings) :warning: to be verified t=
hat this works for all 9 apps</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"20c975cc-9ad6-4e07-922b-b830b1eb9fda">Update of =
linked SZ ID's =E2=86=92 SZ ID has to exist and not assigned to another use=
r, or it will now error out</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"2ccf42f3-10c1-4d94-a892-55653b7a1f9a">Bulk updat=
es in CX user assignments will not bulk update SZ profile settings. Similar=
 to GIC-M app, app access is controlled by the SZ profile but navigation in=
 Compass is by CX user assignment.</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
