</li>
            <li data-uuid=3D"226496ff-0fd5-4458-ab76-10fdfa13d9d9">Depends =
on the single-entry access solution (ensuring Compass is the only entry of =
accessing the SZ apps), there may be administrative work, e.g. resetting SZ=
 user credentials, etc.</li>
